WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.460
This foundation claims that

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.260
it's gonna stay on my face
for up to 30 hours.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.800
So let's put it on test.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.260
It's shade 120. That's my shade.
I guess

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.440
it's a little bit lighter,
but we are gonna make it work.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.840
Amount of foundation on my face
is just insane,

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.440
but trust me, it's very lightweight.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.000
I really like the finish
of this foundation,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.340
because it's actually giving

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.680
very glowy kind of finish,
as you can see.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:30.260
Add a SHEGLAM contour
to balance this out.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.860
I'm gonna add this Essence blush,
which is 01, shade Be Mine,

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.140
and I'm obsessed with it.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.960
I think this is looking pretty good.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.780
Maybelline Lash Sensational Mascara.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.000
I really like this one.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.660
Just applied the lipstick
and opened my hair,

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.420
and this is the final look.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.320
I actually really liked it.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.560
What I like about this
Maybelline Super Stay foundation

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.580
is that it's very lightweight,

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.600
and it gives me, like, a full coverage,

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.220
and it's very glowy and dewy,
as you can see.
